{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/extras/e59ebcf381c6216d3ad4e43cda1d0539.avif?t=1772254527\" width=1224 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udff0\u00a0<strong>A little fantasy of laughter and tears \u2014 a story for the grown-up heart.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a hero in a bug-ridden RPG and fix the bugs.<br>Fix bugs that make you chuckle.<br>Use bugs to fix other problems.<br>Little by little, the world begins to return to its original form.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But the bugs never truly disappear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden there was a past that could not be erased.<br>Please fix this sadness with your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/extras/e64494e625ad63644ecd3d43394e047c.avif?t=1772254527\" width=1224 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique puzzle adventure where you collect the causes of bugs\u2014\u201cBug Programs\u201d\u2014to open new paths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story that goes beyond humor and bittersweet moments, blending in cosmology and philosophy, inviting deeper reflection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A complex, meta-layered world woven from virtual and reality, past and present, failure and hope</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A nostalgic yet fresh visual style, combining pixel art with post-processing effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No time-consuming grinding or growth systems\u2014enjoy a smooth, well-paced experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfa5 Streaming &amp; Let's Play Guidelines</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are <strong>free to stream, create Let's Play videos, and share screenshots</strong> of &quot;RETRYS&quot;!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both commercial and non-commercial use are allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No need for credit or prior permission \u2014 but we\u2019d love to hear from you on X (@retrys_project)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830610/extras/be1169b2c1ce52e736aac8024868ae94.avif?t=1772254527\" width=1224 height=500 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Bug Fix","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/dde553b00cecb1092decfc3f36023ba70dbab212.jpg"},{"name":"Encountered an Anomaly","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/8412e4e5d6148a014a7dbb2dfd60171f522692a7.jpg"},{"name":"Realizing the Cause","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/a8fdb27e4ef068df7f3fdf755ba3fb3be28501dc.jpg"},{"name":"A Mother\u2019s Protection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/0d62d342fa69e87804db40da06488e2e3e3af66f.jpg"},{"name":"Game Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/c3579d6edc91bc62bf424f590dc0568155ee159a.jpg"},{"name":"Even a Fleeting Hope","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/d88f62c6da8f9cf7d27d5609226ef2623bf6a345.jpg"},{"name":"Hot, Hot, Hot!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3830610/82ce3674ecb9c54379c1732d119b65ee8390c67e.jpg"},{"name":"It's a Feature","path":"https://cdn.akama